@host = http://localhost:5152

### 1. Collection with paging, filter and sorting (v1) (exp. 200)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/clients?city=Київ&sort=-id&page=1&pageSize=10

### 2. Client by id (v1) (exp. 200)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/clients/1

### 3. Same client in v2 (exp. 200)
GET {{host}}/api/v2/clients/1

### 4. Request without version (exp. 404)
GET {{host}}/api/clients/1

### 5. Create valid client (exp. 201)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Шевченко Марія Сергіївна",
  "email": "maria@example.com",
  "phone": "+380931234567",
  "city": "Одеса"
}

### 6. Collection sorted by id desc after create (exp. 200)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/clients?sort=-id&page=1&pageSize=10

### 7. Validation error (exp. 400)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "phone": "abc",
  "city": ""
}

### 8. Update client (exp. 204)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/clients/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Петренко Олена Іванівна",
  "email": "olena.new@example.com",
  "phone": "+380501112299",
  "city": "Харків"
}

### 9. Delete client (exp. 204)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/clients/2

### 10. Non-existent client v1 (exp. 404)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/clients/9999

### 11. Non-existent client v2 (exp. 404)
GET {{host}}/api/v2/clients/9999

### 12. Update non-existent client (exp. 404)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/clients/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Тест Тест Тест",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "phone": "+380500000000",
  "city": "Київ"
}

### 13. Delete non-existent client (exp. 404)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/clients/9999

### 14. Final check: collection after update and delete (exp. 200)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/clients?sort=-id&page=1&pageSize=10